1
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:11,220
(Yowayowa Sensei)

2
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:33,960
(Episode 1: Kowakowa-sensei)
Mediocracy is the way of life.

3
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:37,570
That's the conclusion I've reached
after living for 16 years.

4
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:39,720
We're in the same class again.

5
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,570
A friendship with some distance.

6
00:01:41,910 --> 00:01:43,870
- Yeah, we're classmates!
- Just regular classmates.

7
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:45,320
I wonder who's the homeroom teacher.

8
00:01:45,770 --> 00:01:46,420
New semester.

9
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,320
ABIKURA
New semester.

10
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:49,410
A 11TH-GRADE STUDENT STICKING TO MEDIOCRACY
So far, everything's been going well.

11
00:01:49,410 --> 00:01:50,770
SNICKERS

12
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:54,830
If I could just get
a mediocre homeroom teacher…

13
00:01:57,370 --> 00:01:58,270
