18
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:19,660
Is she our homeroom teacher this year?

19
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:22,410
She's Hiyori Hiwamura.

20
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:25,170
On the first day of the new semester, 

21
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:27,470
rumors spread that making her angry
would get you cursed.

22
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:30,880
They even nicknamed her Kowakowa-sensei.

23
