I saw Kowakowa-sensei's notebook
covered in tons of talismans.

24
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:43,220
One day, she suddenly ran into me.

25
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:43,940
THUD

26
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:47,120
MUTTERING
And she said a bunch of

27
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,820
