30
00:02:53,970 --> 00:02:55,830
This is terrible.

31
00:02:56,210 --> 00:02:59,310
Our homeroom teacher is that creepy lady.

32
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:02,120
This is not mediocre at all.

33
00:03:05,370 --> 00:03:11,170
The… the water striders are red. Aiueo.

34
00:03:13,310 --> 00:03:16,910
That's Kowakowa-sensei in there, right?

35
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,710
