58
00:04:29,970 --> 00:04:31,820
It means the mood of a place.

59
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:33,360
Correct.

60
00:04:33,370 --> 00:04:35,820
Anyway, her voice is way too faint.

61
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:38,710
Is my voice a little soft?

62
00:04:39,370 --> 00:04:40,970
Oh, so she does know.

63
00:04:41,710 --> 00:04:42,760
FEELING

64
