76
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:28,860
BREATHING HEAVILY
She's really weak.

77
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:30,920
I can't look away at all

78
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,830
HEART RACING
in every way.

79
00:05:33,170 --> 00:05:35,020
Le… let's take a little break.

80
00:05:35,010 --> 00:05:35,770
SITS DOWN
Le… let's take a little break.

81
