95
00:06:23,670 --> 00:06:26,570
Everyone was startled.

96
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:29,120
That's why she was bleeding so much?

97
00:06:30,010 --> 00:06:31,270
Oh right, 

98
00:06:31,670 --> 00:06:34,170
I need to check the next schedule.

99
00:06:34,170 --> 00:06:35,770
Otherwise, I'll forget it again.

100
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:38,270
COVERED
They're not talismans, 

101
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:38,910
CHANGED ENGLISH CLASS TO LITERATURE CLASS
but notes?

102
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:39,570
NEW TEACHER INTRODUCTION AFTER OPENING CEREMONY
but notes?

103
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:44,610
She bumped into me.

104
00:06:44,610 --> 00:06:46,760
So… sorry.

105
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,970
Sounds like she's muttering a curse.

106
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:51,270
I see. The mystery is solved.

107
00:06:52,110 --> 00:06:55,260
My homeroom teacher
isn't a Kowakowa-sensei.

108
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:56,660
She has a weak voice

109
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:58,210
and poor stamina, 

110
