Um… I should probably get going.

112
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:09,870
Um… thank you.

113
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,470
Ex… excuse me, could you say that again?

114
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,420
Abikura-kun, 

115
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:21,070
thank you for saving me.

116
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,760
I've fallen for her.

117
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:27,170
I can't take it anymore.

118
00:07:27,810 --> 00:07:31,760
Ever since then, I've been thinking
about that strange teacher.

119
00:07:31,770 --> 00:07:34,320
One, two.

120
