147
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:55,270
Abikura-kun.

148
00:08:55,270 --> 00:08:56,960
Don't get me wrong, this is…

149
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:59,960
Our school's sports festival

150
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,860
ONE, TWO
in October

151
