so many times like practicing kanji?

198
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:21,870
She tries very hard, 

199
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:23,660
but she's a bit clumsy.

200
00:11:24,070 --> 00:11:27,070
I wonder if there's anything
I can help with.

201
00:11:36,620 --> 00:11:38,420
Hiwamura-sensei?

202
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:40,320
GLANCES
She's crying so dramatically.

203
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,780
GLANCES
What is she looking at?

204
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:44,610
Author's recent photo?

205
00:11:44,610 --> 00:11:46,910
